EFG 2 R "Chainstore paradox (McKelvey and Palfrey 1998, Figure 1a)" { "Entrant" "Incumbent" }
"The one-shot chainstore paradox stage game (sequential version), as presented
in :cite:p:`McKPal98`, Figure 1(a). Player 1 is the entrant (N = Not Enter,
E = Enter) and player 2 is the incumbent (F = Fight, A = Acquiesce)."

p "" 1 1 "" { "N" "E" } 0
t "" 1 "Not Enter" { 2, 2 }
p "" 2 1 "" { "F" "A" } 0
t "" 2 "Fight" { 0, 0 }
t "" 3 "Acquiesce" { 3, 1 }
